# REGRESSION: the KEYS page with the keys' octave all the way down (a note below zero named a key by a negative index into the
# note names: a read before the table, a hard fault on the device). Both octaves down (the keys' and the track's), WHITE off
# (the degree numbers hide the names). Under ASAN/UBSAN the old code is reported here.
wait 300
tap EDIT
wait 100
expect page 5
row 0
turn K3 -1 8
wait 150
turn K3 -1 8
wait 150
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
row 2
turn K4 -1 8
wait 150
turn K4 -1 8
wait 150
turn K4 -1 8
wait 150
turn K4 -1 8
wait 150
key w0 down 90
wait 150
key w0 up
wait 100
key w2 down 90
wait 150
key w2 up
wait 100
expect inv 0
turn K1 1 5
wait 150
turn K2 1 5
wait 150
turn K3 1 5
wait 150
turn K4 1 5
wait 150
turn K1 -1 5
wait 150
turn K2 -1 5
wait 150
turn K3 -1 5
wait 150
turn K4 -1 5
wait 150
expect inv 0
